# passive_aux.voc — Past/subjunctive forms of ser (foi, foram, fosse…) = passive auxiliary. Mark a
# following past participle as VERB (+4) and 'posto' as the closed-o noun-like
# participle (+8). Only past/subjunctive forms — present 'é/são' is a copula.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

foi
fora
foram
forem
fosse
fossem
